01:19:35.237 --> 01:19:39.508
Mike Thibault is like a [kissing sound]
"chef's kiss" drafter.

01:19:39.508 --> 01:19:42.344
So whoever does go,
you already know he did his homework.

01:19:42.344 --> 01:19:47.749
I might say, oh,
I think they kind of need NaLyssa.

01:19:47.749 --> 01:19:49.818
It's really between
NaLyssa Smith and Rhyne Howard.

01:19:50.252 --> 01:19:51.820
I think they might need Smith

01:19:51.820 --> 01:19:54.990
a little more cuz they kind of
are set in their guards.

01:19:55.423 --> 01:19:57.492
But I'm telling you, if he picks
Rhyne Howard, he sees something.

01:19:57.626 --> 01:19:59.161
- Yeah?
- Yep.
- Oh, I love that.

01:19:59.161 --> 01:20:01.463
- He's an excellent drafter. Excellent.

01:20:01.463 --> 01:20:02.297
- I have a question.

01:20:02.297 --> 01:20:04.399
I mean, I guess I've had questions this whole time.
- [Laughing]

01:20:04.399 --> 01:20:06.835
