[Both laughing]

01:20:06.835 --> 01:20:11.907
But you have not won a championship
in an odd year.

01:20:11.940 --> 01:20:14.376
- I know.
- It's 2022.

01:20:15.343 --> 01:20:17.546
What we feeling about this
year?

01:20:17.546 --> 01:20:18.947
We've got an even one.

01:20:18.947 --> 01:20:21.316
The cards are on your side.
- They are.

01:20:21.316 --> 01:20:23.652
They are. I feel, I mean, oof.

01:20:23.652 --> 01:20:25.987
I feel OK. I never feel good.

01:20:26.054 --> 01:20:28.690
So it's like, any year we've won,
I've never felt good.

01:20:28.690 --> 01:20:29.991
So maybe it's a good thing
I don't feel good.

01:20:29.991 --> 01:20:33.862
But we have, like, essentially same people
