01:20:38.867 --> 01:20:42.070
but we added a lot of new players
with a lot of talent, so I'm excited.

01:20:42.470 --> 01:20:43.471
- OK. I'm excited.

01:20:43.471 --> 01:20:45.774
I'm gonna come back
- Oh, you're definitely coming…
- to Seattle.

01:20:45.774 --> 01:20:48.043
