01:21:10.398 --> 01:21:12.834
But I'm going on to a total tangent.

01:21:12.834 --> 01:21:14.536
You were fantastic.

01:21:14.536 --> 01:21:15.904
Thank you so much for doing this.

01:21:15.904 --> 01:21:17.806
